# Origamic prompts: http://...
# Generate code from this with: npx origamic gen

GetFoo:
  Hello $name,

  What's up $name?

  Context: $context

  Make sure to match this schema:
  $<schema hide>
    interface FullName {
      firstName: string;
      lastName: string;
    }

    type Response = FullName[];
  $</schema>

  For example:
  $<example>
    [
      {
        "firstName": "Jane",
        "lastName": "Do"
      },
      {
        "firstName": "John",
        "lastName": "Do"
      },
      {...},
      ...
    ]
  $</example>

GetName:
  Hi
